WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.204
Danny: Where are we?

2
00:00:13.205 --> 00:00:17.941
Brad: There’s some sort of a cord here.

3
00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:21.532
Tina: That’s strange. We’re in a closet.

4
00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:30.931
Danny: I think I know where we are . . .

5
00:00:30.932 --> 00:00:33.098
Danny: We’re back at school.

6
00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.764
Brad: And recess seems to be over.

7
00:00:35.765 --> 00:00:42.171
Tina: Maybe this has all been a dream.

8
00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:48.456
Brad: Nope. It wasn’t a dream.

9
00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:51.639
Tina: Bello, no!

10
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.980
Danny: We’ve got to stop him.

11
00:00:53.981 --> 00:00:57.086
Brad: Forget that! We’ve got to hide him.

12
00:00:57.087 --> 00:01:01.332
Danny: Right! Where is everybody?

13
00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:08.217
Brad: They’re in class, lucky for us.

14
00:01:08.218 --> 00:01:10.853
Tina: How are we going to catch him?

15
00:01:10.854 --> 00:01:14.952
Danny: We’ve got to slow him down first.

16
00:01:14.953 --> 00:01:18.464
Brad: How do you slow down a runaway giant?

17
00:01:18.465 --> 00:01:20.768
Tina: I’ve got an idea!

18
00:01:20.769 --> 00:01:23.866
Danny: Well, let’s see it.

19
00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:30.248
Tina: Bello, stop!

20
00:01:30.249 --> 00:01:32.814
Bello: Stop.

21
00:01:32.815 --> 00:01:34.526
Danny: He listened to you!

22
00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.752
Tina: I know how to talk to babies.

23
00:01:36.753 --> 00:01:40.517
Tina: I have to babysit my little brother all the time.

24
00:01:40.518 --> 00:01:43.551
Brad: Well, that was easy.

25
00:01:43.552 --> 00:01:46.198
Tina: Bello, come here.

26
00:01:46.199 --> 00:01:48.995
Bello: Come.

27
00:01:48.996 --> 00:01:54.074
Danny: Wow! A giant who obeys your every command!

28
00:01:54.075 --> 00:01:58.301
Tina: Walk with me, Bello. It’s okay.

29
00:01:58.302 --> 00:02:01.543
Gently, Bello, gently.

30
00:02:01.544 --> 00:02:03.750
Bello: Gentle.

31
00:02:03.751 --> 00:02:06.727
Brad: Okay. Now we can go hide him.

32
00:02:06.728 --> 00:02:09.343
Tina: We need an empty room.

33
00:02:09.344 --> 00:02:10.969
Danny: The art room!

34
00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:13.274
No one will be in it now!

35
00:02:13.275 --> 00:02:15.920
Brad: That’s right.

36
00:02:15.921 --> 00:02:18.369
Danny: Wait! I hear footsteps.

37
00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:25.160
There’s somebody coming down the hall.

38
00:02:25.161 --> 00:02:28.015
Tina: Run, Bello, run!

39
00:02:28.016 --> 00:02:30.274
Brad: We can’t get caught now!

40
00:02:30.275 --> 00:02:42.360
Danny: We’d never get back to Ginormous if we did!

41
00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.555
Danny: I think he’s gone.

42
00:02:44.556 --> 00:02:46.439
Tina: That was close.

43
00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:52.504
Brad: Yeah. If we get caught, we'll have to wash blackboards for a year.

44
00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:56.770
Bello: Boo!
